WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:00.300
Plan and approach

00:01:00.300 --> 00:02:39.228
Galaxea 0.5 grasping; Sol monitors

00:02:39.228 --> 00:03:53.232
Sol takes over: lift check reveals a slipped grasp

00:03:53.232 --> 00:04:22.432
Recovery: failed manual grasp; reopen and reposition

00:04:22.432 --> 00:05:14.745
Regrasp holds; Sol adapts the lift path

00:05:14.745 --> 00:06:20.553
Full Sol control: carry, lower, and correct placement

00:06:20.553 --> 00:06:34.833
Release and withdraw with the control budget almost exhausted
